WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.320 align:start position:0%
If you dig a hole in a ring around your
yard and fill it with water, you have a

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:09.080 align:start position:0%
lazy river. But by morning, half of it
is gone, soaked into the dirt, and the

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:13.200 align:start position:0%
muddy banks are slumping in. So, you
line it like your pool with a cage of

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.240 align:start position:0%
steel and a shell of sprayed concrete
bent into a ring. It holds water now,

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:21.080 align:start position:0%
but it just sits there. A river that
does not move is just a very long

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:24.720 align:start position:0%
puddle. So, you add a pump. It pulls
water in through a drain and fires it

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:28.440 align:start position:0%
back out through jets in the wall, all
aimed the same way, so the whole ring

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:32.800 align:start position:0%
starts to turn. This is a propulsion
jet, but on every bend the water piles

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:36.280 align:start position:0%
up against the outer wall and spills
onto your lawn, because moving water

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:40.320 align:start position:0%
wants to go straight. So, you build the
outside of every curve taller like a

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:43.480 align:start position:0%
racetrack. But after a week of sun, it
is green and full of your neighbor's

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:46.840 align:start position:0%
leaves. So, you send it through the same
sand filter as your pool, and a skimmer

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:50.160 align:start position:0%
on the wall eats the leaves as they
float past. The current does the

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:54.440 align:start position:0%
cleaning for you. And here is what
nobody tells you. The river is not

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:58.320 align:start position:0%
carrying you. You are slowing it down.
Every person in it is a brake. So, on a

00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:02.640 align:start position:0%
busy day, the pump has to push even
harder. Add a little bridge, two palm

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:07.280 align:start position:0%
trees, and a stack of inner tubes.
Congratulations, you have built a lazy

00:01:04.839 --> 00:01:07.280 align:start position:0%
river.

